Error [E2411]: `TCPStream` can't be serialized
  --> tests/ui/http_server_json_not_encodable.jet:4:27
   |
 4 |     _ :: server.json(200, v)
   |                           ^
 Why: only types that opt in (and their fields) have a wire form; `TCPStream` does not
 Fix: add `#[Codable]` or `#[Encode]` to `TCPStream`, or remove it from the encoded value
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2411
